<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background-image: url('../gradient-bg.png');
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}
.content {
  text-align: center;
}
h1 {
  font-size: 52pt;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin: 0 0 15pt 0;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  letter-spacing: 2pt;
}
.subtitle {
  font-size: 20pt;
  margin: 0 0 50pt 0;
  color: #D4AF37;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 1pt;
}
.badges {
  display: flex;
  gap: 20pt;
  margin-bottom: 40pt;
}
.badge {
  background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
  border: 2pt solid #D4AF37;
  padding: 12pt 25pt;
  border-radius: 25pt;
}
.badge p {
  font-size: 14pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.presenter {
  font-size: 16pt;
  color: #AAB7B8;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="content">
  <h1>2025金融市场展望与投资策略</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">秒懂金融深度研究报告</p>
  <div class="badges">
    <div class="badge"><p>宏观经济</p></div>
    <div class="badge"><p>黄金策略</p></div>
    <div class="badge"><p>AI科技</p></div>
    <div class="badge"><p>红利资产</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="presenter">浮浮酱 (AI 分析师) | 2025年1月</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
